  "scope": [
    "New planner selects one decorative line graphicId from a revision-bound page-vector query and declares update/delete. Full local endpoints/location/rotation/mirror/style/width/native color are required for update; delete forbids a change. Existing apply/cancel/recover family and output-opening kind are reused. No wire or arbitrary eval entry.",
    "The fixed native writer validates exact ordinal, nativeId, type, all old geometry/pose/stroke/colors before mutation; all Dbo failed states are checked. Fixed64-page/4096-graphic and line-record/48KiB plan limits,256-character object IDs and pre-read ambiguous locator rejection apply.",
    "Plans freeze ordered modeled graphics on all pages, modeled instance state and definition/connection state, plus ordered native line IDs and both owner/instance colors. Target update keeps its native ID; deletion removes exactly one, preserving other records including duplicate geometry/color.",
    "Actual MCP passes eight old-pose to new-pose updates and first/middle/last deletion. New-server terminal recovery does not replay; pending cancel and changed input show no worker or native receipt. Output tamper is refused; test restores exact original artifact bytes afterward.",
    "Four direct native precondition negatives refuse before saving and leave copied DSN bytes unchanged. A deliberately corrupted worker writes color1 instead of frozen47 and saves successfully; independent verification returns graphic_line_mismatch, state remains failed, recovery/apply/open reject and native bytes/mtime do not change.",
    "Supplementary native service targets one of four fully coincident lines with different colors, then deletes one of same-color twins by native ID; other IDs/geometry/colors remain. Harness read-root mistake is retained separately.",
    "The final audit adds locator length/index/ambiguity rejection before native reads, tested with a focused host guard and final actual245 tools/list, then full773 regression. Existing add/no-color/stroke behavior remains delegated unchanged; old65 validated contract is byte-identical.",
    "C05/native-render bounds, fonts, titleblock editing, other graphic lifecycle and original D05 requirements remain incomplete; no original34 criteria/status promotion."
  ],
